# MPRIS wizard
msgid "Add Music Player"
msgstr "Ajouter un lecteur de musique"

msgid "Adding an MPRIS compatible player"
msgstr "Ajouter un lecteur compatible MPRIS"

msgid "New Media Player"
msgstr "Nouveau lecteur multimédia"

msgid ""
"This wizard adds a MPRIS compatible media player\n"
"to the list of SqueezeBox controllable backends.\n"
"\n"
"MPRIS is the 'Media Player Remote Interfacing Specification'.\n"
"See <a href=\"https://specifications.freedesktop.org/mpris-spec/latest/\">here</a> for details.\n"
"\n"
"If your player does not support the MPRIS interfaces\n"
"by itself, it may have a plugin that does.\n"
msgstr ""
"Cet assistant ajoute un lecteur multimédia compatible MPRIS\n"
"à la liste des backends contrôlables par SqueezeBox.\n"
"\n"
"MPRIS est la 'Media Player Remote Interfacing Specification'.\n"
"Voir <a href=\"https://specifications.freedesktop.org/mpris-spec/latest/\">ici</a> pour plus de détails.\n"
"\n"
"Si votre lecteur ne prend pas en charge les interfaces MPRIS\n"
"nativement, il existe peut-être un plugin qui le fait.\n"

msgid "label"
msgstr "étiquette"
